    "name": "Keystone Highball",
    "instructions": "1. Fill a highball or Collins glass two-thirds full with ice.\n2. Stir to chill the glass, then drain off any water.\n3. Pour the tea, St-Germain and whiskey into the glass and stir gently to combine.\n4. Pour soda water down the side of the glass so as to retain carbonation.\n5. Add ice and top with a final splash of soda water.\n6. Express the lemon peel, then discard.\n7. Garnish with fresh bay leaf.",
